 "purpose": "Reports for parents: per period, per day, per skill, thinking errors, calendar, CSV/text export, and the parent's log of answers and points.",
 "details": "Everything here returns plain data or lines of (text, role); the screen chooses the colours. A Rapport is built from the answers in a period plus the all-time status per skill and the repeat bin; regels() turns it into text lines, optionally grouped per subject and domain using an 'indeling' (stored id -> (subject, domain, topic)) that the terminal takes from the curriculum. Speed-practice answers are reported under their session's skill. The export writes a CSV (semicolon-separated with BOM so Excel reads UTF-8) and a TXT, and a full JSON export of one child. The log helpers (antwoorden_lijst, punten_regels) and the 'put a question back in the repeat bin' helpers serve Ouders > Antwoorden (#24).",
 "module_docstring": "Rapporten voor ouders: per periode, per dag, per vaardigheid, denkfouten, kalender en export.",
